---
import { affiliateLinks } from "../../../data/affiliateLinks";
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-700 via-fuchsia-700 to-pink-600 py-24 text-white">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

<div class="grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2">

<div>

<span class="rounded-full bg-white/20 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold">

⭐ 4.6 / 5 • CreatorStack Review

</span>

<h1 class="mt-8 text-6xl font-extrabold">

Murf AI Review (2026)

</h1>

<p class="mt-8 text-xl leading-9 text-purple-100">

Murf AI is one of the most popular AI voice generators for businesses, educators, marketers, and YouTube creators. But does it deserve its reputation? We tested Murf AI to find out.

</p>

<div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-5">

<a
href={affiliateLinks.murf}
target="_blank"
rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
class="rounded-2xl bg-white px-8 py-4 font-bold text-purple-700 transition hover:scale-105"
>

🚀 Try Murf AI

</a>

<a
href="#pricing"
class="rounded-2xl border border-white/40 px-8 py-4 font-bold hover:bg-white/10"
>

View Pricing

</a>

</div>

</div>

<div class="flex justify-center">

<img
src="/images/tools/murf.png"
alt="Murf AI Review"
class="w-72 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl"
/>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>